sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Grid Admin
    participant Enrollment as Enrollment Service<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant OpA as Operator (Site A)<br/>9090/TCP
    participant OpB as Operator (Site B)<br/>9090/TCP
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GwA as Gateway (Site A)<br/>8080/TCP HTTPS
    participant GwB as Gateway (Site B)<br/>8080/TCP HTTPS
    participant Client as Client
    participant Backend as Inference Backend

    Note over Admin,PG: Flow 1: Site Enrollment

    Admin->>Enrollment: POST /v1alpha1/enrollmenttokens<br/>Auth: Grid-admin credential (RBAC)
    Enrollment->>PG: Store enrollment token<br/>TLS (optional)
    Enrollment-->>Admin: Token

    OpB->>Enrollment: POST /v1alpha1/enrollments<br/>Auth: Single-use token + CSR
    Enrollment->>PG: Record enrollment, sign CSR
    Enrollment-->>OpB: Signed mTLS certificate

    Note over OpA,K8s: Flow 2: Mesh Formation & Overlay Rendering

    OpA->>OpB: SWIM gossip<br/>7946/UDP AES-256-GCM<br/>Shared symmetric key
    OpB-->>OpA: Membership + CRDT state deltas

    OpA->>OpB: GET /signals<br/>9091/TCP HTTPS mTLS<br/>Site certificate
    OpB-->>OpA: Provider health + metrics

    OpA->>K8s: Watch CRDs<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8s-->>OpA: GridNetwork, GridSite,<br/>InferenceProvider, AgentToolProvider

    OpA->>OpA: Score providers<br/>(noMetrics / queueDepth / kvCachePressure)

    OpA->>K8s: Write ConfigMap (routing overlay)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS

    Note over GwA,GwB: Flow 3: Inference Request Routing

    Client->>GwA: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS TLS<br/>Bearer token
    GwA->>GwA: Read routing overlay<br/>(hot-reload from ConfigMap)
    GwA->>GwB: Forward to best-scored site<br/>HTTPS mTLS<br/>Site certificate
    GwB->>Backend: Route to inference backend<br/>HTTPS/HTTP<br/>Backend credential (injected)
    Backend-->>GwB: Inference response
    GwB-->>GwA: Response (mTLS)
    GwA-->>Client: JSON response
